 <kari.lise.monsen@tietoevry.com>\; vildesol_29@hotmail.com 
 <vildesol_29@hotmail.com>\nEmne: Invitation to games\, dinner and drinks 
 - Bergen\nNår: tirsdag 11. november 2025 17:30-22:00.\nHvor: Microsoft 
 Teams Meeting\n\nHi all\,\n\nHere are some updates and more information 
 😊\n\nWe meet at Varanasi<https://varanasi.no/om-oss/>\, Strandkaien 
 18\, at 17.30 for dinner.\n\nAt 19.30 we will walk to https:
 //alltidopplett.no/ and play indoor golf from 19.45.\n\nWe are still 
 missing some responses from some of you\, please accept/decline this 
 invitation so we know how many will be joining. ( I hope I don´t mess 
 this up with sending this update for those of you already 
 accepted…..please check if your response is still valid…)\n\nLooking 
 forward to seeing everyone and have some fun :-)\n\nBr\,\nAnn 
 Kristin\n\n_______________________________________________________________
